# Kiezel: the login screen (plasmalogin greeter) uses large text for everyone (Phase 3, owner
# decision: no privileged code). Only the greeter reads this directory, through
# /usr/lib/systemd/user/plasma-login.service.d/50-kiezel-large-text.conf. A login screen synced from
# System Settings (/var/lib/plasmalogin/.config/kdeglobals) takes precedence, as usual.
